                                                "sense_id": "619c591d-33b8-3600-9f4a-dcc45806c7af",
                                                "text": "Cattle are shot with stones and can only be cured by a \"fairy dart\" or ancient stone arrowhead. These objects are kept in numerous wrappings by every properly qualified \"fairy doctor,\" who rub[s] them on the sick beasts with appropriate charms ..."
